&quot;Ammo: &quot;..
script.Parent.Parent.Parent.Parent.Parent.Character:findFirstChild(&quot;Game Tool&quot;).WeaponList.W8.Ammo.Value
script.Parent.Parent.Parent.Parent.Health.Tray.Clip.Text = 
&quot;Clip: &quot;..
script.Parent.Parent.Parent.Parent.Parent.Character:findFirstChild(&quot;Game Tool&quot;).WeaponList.W8.Clip.Value
